Model outputs
-------------

Some of the released data was generated by claude-opus-5 through Anthropic's
API: the model responses in logs/, the patched programs in data/results/ (as
files in data/results/patched_programs/ and as program text in attempts.jsonl
and patches.jsonl), and the candidate programs in data/scenarios/candidates/,
one of which, with a comment header added by Neel Mistry, is the frozen
baseline; data/scenarios/dsl_probe/clean_repair.bt is the model's clean repair.
Under Anthropic's Commercial Terms the customer owns its outputs (checked 10 Oct
2026); Neel Mistry, the API customer, releases these outputs under CC BY 4.0
with the rest of data/ and logs/.


