0.9.16. No CARLA code, binaries or assets, including the Town05 map, are
redistributed here. According to the CARLA README at tag 0.9.16, CARLA-specific
code is distributed under the MIT License and CARLA-specific assets under CC-BY,
and Unreal Engine follows its own licence terms.

Workshop style file. paper/neurips_2026_vericode.sty is the LaTeX style file
distributed by the organizers of the NeurIPS 2026 Workshop on AI for Verifiable
Coding for preparing papers. It carries no licence statement, is included only
so that the paper builds, and is not covered by LICENSE or by this file.

